sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Entry as Telegram / CLI
    participant Hub as Agent Hub
    participant Reg as Specialist contracts
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant Graph as Hub LangGraph
    participant Specialist as Eligible specialist

    You->>Entry: initial task
    Entry->>Hub: forward message
    Hub->>Reg: read advertised task kinds
    Reg-->>Hub: enabled specialist contracts
    Hub->>Hub: LLM classifies route + task_kind
    Hub->>Hub: deterministically validate and filter eligibility
    Hub->>Runs: create / route task run
    Hub->>Graph: expose only eligible specialist tool(s)
    Graph->>Specialist: invoke bounded task

    Specialist-->>Hub: status: needs_clarification
    Hub->>Runs: transition waiting_clarification
    Hub-->>Entry: relay specialist question
    Entry-->>You: clarification needed

    You->>Entry: clarification reply
    Entry->>Hub: resume paused run
    Hub->>Runs: transition routed
    Hub->>Specialist: resume with clarification

    Specialist-->>Hub: structured result
    Hub->>Runs: finalize succeeded / paused / failed
    Hub-->>Entry: operator-facing response
    Entry-->>You: result
